Z||000012||BENGAL4||07-28-2000||01:24 AM||||I wan't to thank each and everyone of my Fiero family for your support in this time of need. Don't worry about not knowing what to say because no one does. The best thing to do is just listen and give support, which you all have. I have lost a friend and a partner, but my girls have lost thier mother. There is nothing I can do or say to soften this blow for my children. Our faith in Christ will get us through this tragedy. I have no doubt where Stormy is right now. She was a great wife and mother. She will be missed by many, many people because she touched so many lives. Thanks again for your thoughts and prayers.<P>Bill||||reg||1
